        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Associate an <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref> with this analysis.</para><para>The <ref refid="classRose_1_1EditDistance_1_1LinearEditDistance_1_1Analysis_1ac1752d2c15b3621efdc11c6938657f60" kindref="member">setTree1</ref> sets the source <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref> and <ref refid="classRose_1_1EditDistance_1_1LinearEditDistance_1_1Analysis_1aeea98b424ccf58f333379d2a1594caf6" kindref="member">setTree2</ref> sets the target <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref>. It does so by forgetting any previous source or target list nodes, traversing the specified tree to select new source or target nodes, creating a list of NodeType nodes, and storing the list in this analysis.</para><para>During traversal, <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref> nodes whose tree depth is between <computeroutput>minDepth</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>maxDepth</computeroutput>, inclusive are added to the list. However, if a <computeroutput>file</computeroutput> is specified then the node must also belong to the specified file. </para>        </detaileddescription>
