        <detaileddescription>
<para>Compute edit distance.</para><para>The no-argument version computes edit distance over the source and target ASTs that have been previously added to this analysis object. The other versions call <ref refid="classRose_1_1EditDistance_1_1LinearEditDistance_1_1Analysis_1aeea98b424ccf58f333379d2a1594caf6" kindref="member">setTree2</ref> and/or <ref refid="classRose_1_1EditDistance_1_1LinearEditDistance_1_1Analysis_1ac1752d2c15b3621efdc11c6938657f60" kindref="member">setTree1</ref> before doing the computation.</para><para>Returns this analysis object so that a query method can be chained:</para><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">size_t<sp/>distance<sp/>=<sp/>LinearEditDistance::Analysis&lt;&gt;::compute(ast1,ast2).cost();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>        </detaileddescription>
