    <detaileddescription>
<para>Edit distance analysis.</para><para>Analyzes two ASTs to determine the edit distance between them using the following algorithm:</para><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Traverse the trees, selecting certain <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref> nodes. </para></listitem>
<listitem><para>For each selected <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref> node, create an instance of <computeroutput>NodeType</computeroutput> and append it to a list. </para></listitem>
<listitem><para>Compute and return the Levenshtein edit distance of the two lists. </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
